// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : taskMission 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2142297206" "One of our Longbow communications officers has acquired some tactical intelligence on villain activities within the zone. Unfortunately, he has been kidnapped by Arachnos before he could deliver the intel to us! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over to the Arachnos base and rescue our communications officer!</A><br><br>It's only a matter of time before Arachnos finds what our communications officer knows. You have 60 minutes to complete the mission!<br><br><color red>PvP Mission: This mission will bring you into direct conflict with villains.</color>"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


