"P3294778950" "One of Longbow's researchers has developed a new ablative compound which can be applied to uniforms to temporarily enhance its protective capabilities. Unfortunately, Arachnos has intercepted the shipment! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over to the Arachnos base and recover the shipment.</A><br><br>Arachnos will be sending the compound to the Rogue Isles to reverse-engineer it. You have 60 minutes to complete this mission!<br><br><color red>PvP Mission: This mission will bring you into direct conflict with villains.</color>"
